From f7c66ddc6c4e25c18a6052914f3354cc6e0d9170 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: telegdyd <telegdyd93@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:49:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] jasmine-j0099: wrapped client memory (IOSurfaceAddress) no
 longer wired for the surface's life, only by GPU users; reboot dump: mutex
 owners, gIOMemoryLock owner, VM object paging/activity counts, 32-frame
 backtraces 8 a line, pinned client memory at RootUnmount (j97-aj2: surface
 closes waited 30 s for IOKit's memory lock while vm_object_destroy waited
 under it)

